1
00:00:00,112 --> 00:00:01,646
Sumpah Pemuda...

2
00:00:01,646 --> 00:00:03,545
lahir dari secarik kertas.

3
00:00:03,545 --> 00:00:05,341
Dan bisikan pertamanya...

4
00:00:05,341 --> 00:00:06,445
bahasa Belanda.

5
00:00:06,445 --> 00:00:08,213
Malam terakhir Kongres Pemuda,

6
00:00:08,213 --> 00:00:10,037
polisi Belanda ikut mengawasi.

7
00:00:10,037 --> 00:00:11,216
Di tengah pidato,

8
00:00:11,216 --> 00:00:13,789
Yamin menyodorkan kertas
ke ketua kongres...

9
00:00:13,789 --> 00:00:15,893
Saya punya rumusan yang lebih elegan.

10
00:00:15,893 --> 00:00:17,481
Sugondo memaraf setuju,

11
00:00:17,481 --> 00:00:18,503
kertas beredar,

12
00:00:18,503 --> 00:00:20,935
dan malam itu ikrarnya dibacakan.

13
00:00:20,935 --> 00:00:22,909
Tapi coba cek ikrar ketiga:

14
00:00:22,909 --> 00:00:24,481
bukan "berbahasa satu"...

15
00:00:24,481 --> 00:00:26,960
melainkan menjunjung bahasa persatuan.

16
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:29,976
Kirim ke temanmu yang masih
hafal "berbahasa satu"!
